# Sensor hub drivers
#

config IIO_MSP430
	tristate "Motorola TI MSP430 sensor hub"
	depends on I2C
	select IIO_TRIGGERED_BUFFER
	help
	  Say yes here to build support for the TI MSP430 sensor processor
	  found in Motorola mapphone devices (e.g., Droid RAZR XT910/XT912).
	  The MSP430 acts as a sensor hub and exposes accelerometer, gyroscope,
	  magnetometer, pressure and temperature data over an I2C register
	  protocol.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called msp430.
